return {
    ["\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\">布满污迹的纸条上，只剩几行还能辨认的字：</>\n“我终于明白了……”\n“第一轮是<Letter_Highlight_HW>二号</>！二号是<Letter_Highlight_HW>真的</>！”\n“欲念使者说的都是<Letter_Highlight_HW>实话</>，可我们还是会死——”\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">字迹断了</>，<Hide id=\"#157\">后面是一道擦过的暗色污痕。</>                                                                                         "] = "\n<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" u=\"1\" id=\"#160_R\">On the stained note, only a few lines remain legible:</>\n\"I finally understand...\"\n\"The first round is <Letter_Highlight_HW>number two</>! Number two is <Letter_Highlight_HW>real</>!\"\n\"What the Desire Messenger said is all <Letter_Highlight_HW>truth</>, but we will still die—\"\n<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">The handwriting broke</>, <Hide id=\"#157\">behind it is a dark stain that has been wiped.</>                                                                                         ",
    ["%s件公示"] = "%s Items Publicized",
    ["1-开启, 其他值-关闭"] = "1-Enable, other values-Disable",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Great Temptation of Dried Fish】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Pavlov always has a strange fragrance about him. It is said that those who pass by him will quietly find a string of furry \"tails\" following behind them.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[廷根(600,1194)]|-38980;19160;-3230;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Great Temptation of Dried Fish】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Pavlov always has a strange fragrance about him. It is said that those who pass by him will quietly find a string of furry \"tails\" following behind them.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(600,1194)]|-38980;19160;-3230;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<P_Heart>（不知道马西莫有没有发现……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I wonder if Massimo noticed...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他是怎么认路的？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(How does he know the way?)</>",
