    ["{{PlayerName}}{{先生|女士}} is my customer and new friend."] = "{{PlayerName}} {{Sir|Madam}} is my customer and new friend.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演祈光人】\n一座老宅夜夜传出异响，它的继承人站在门外，始终不敢推门。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Light Seeker】 \n An old mansion emits strange noises every night, and its heir stands outside the door, never daring to push it open.",
    ["【测试】一键养成64级小R"] = "[Test] One-click development level 64 small-spender",
    ["丰收、富饶、生机勃勃。持有一段时间后背负诅咒，你死去时原地长出活化土地，为友方持续回血、提升攻击并免疫控制。但土地存在期间，你无法复活。"] = "Harvest, richness, and vitality. After holding it for a period of time, you bear a Curse; when you die, activated land grows on the spot, continuously healing teammates, increasing Attack, and granting immunity to control. But while the land exists, you cannot be Resurrected.",
    ["举起奖杯"] = "Raise the trophy",
    ["二十二条神之途径之一\n序列9：仲裁人、序列8：治安官、序列7：审讯者、序列6：法官、序列5：惩戒骑士、序列4：律令法师、序列3：混乱猎手、序列2：平衡者、序列1：秩序之手、序列0：审判者"] = "One of the twenty-two divine pathways\nSequence 9: Arbiter, Sequence 8: Sheriff, Sequence 7: Interrogator, Sequence 6: Judge, Sequence 5: Disciplinary Paladin, Sequence 4: Imperative Mage, Sequence 3: Chaos Hunter, Sequence 2: Balancer, Sequence 1: Hand of Order, Sequence 0: Justiciar",
    ["五分钟，女士。只要先给我们五分钟……"] = "Five minutes, ma'am. Just give us five minutes...",
    ["仅展示贵重物品获取信息"] = "Only display acquisition information for valuable items",
