    ["你喊是没用的，还是浇醒他吧。"] = "It's useless to shout at him, better splash some water to wake him up.",
    ["你早晚会知道的。在这之前，不如先决定一下要不要接受这份拍摄委托。当然，这只是个建议，拍不拍随你。只不过，如果错过的话，就很无趣了。"] = "You will know sooner or later. Before that, why not decide whether you want to accept this photography commission? Of course, this is just a suggestion; it's up to you whether you take it or not. It's just that it would be very dull if you missed it.",
    ["你的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对<Chat_Red>未知目标</>造成了<Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "Your <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </> to the unknown target <Chat_Red> </>.",
    ["使用后打开装备选择界面，可选择1件羁绊纹章。"] = "Use to open the equipment selection interface and choose 1 Bond Emblem.",
    ["使用岁月的棋局后自身获得8秒15%的减伤，岁月的棋局伤害提高100%。"] = "After using Gambit of the Ages, gain 15% Damage Reduction for 8 seconds; Gambit of the Ages damage increased by 100%.",
    ["保留最近的购买与出售记录各30条"] = "Keep the last 30 purchase and sale records each",
    ["兄弟们，动手！"] = "Brothers, do it!",
    ["先生，这条观光路线大约需要一小时。按时间算一小时2苏勒，超过后每刻加6便士。如果按里程，城里是一公里4便士。您看哪种合适？ "] = "Sir, this sightseeing route takes about an hour. By time, it's 2 soli per hour, with 6 pennies for every quarter-hour after that. If by distance, it's 4 pennies per kilometer in the city. Which do you think is better?",
    ["兔主人"] = "Rabbit Owner",
    ["养了灵体宠物，淘的古玩越来越多以后，我觉得我逐渐有了某种\"通灵\"能力。我这几天心脏扑通扑通跳，平时去镇外的工厂工作回家，都不敢走古堡那条路。今天看镇上的告示板说，一个低序列居民一家四口被杀了，我居然尤其联想到，会不会我就是下一个呢？我有种预感，今晚有大事发生。不过多亏了我淘的那些古玩，还有我可爱的灵蛇灵鼠们，我现在特别兴奋，就好像，有人会帮我解决这些事一样……我会把窗门好好关上，把“那个东西”放在床边，万一真的来了，我就……"] = "After keeping spirit pets and collecting more and more antiques, I feel that I have gradually developed a kind of \"mediumship\" ability. My heart has been thumping these past few days. When I go home from work at the factory outside the town, I don't dare to take the road by the ancient castle. Seeing the notice board in town today, it said that a family of four, who were low-sequence residents, had been killed. I actually especially associated it with whether I would be the next one? I have a premonition that something big will happen tonight. But thanks to the antiques I collected, and my cute spirit snakes and spirit mice, I am especially excited now, as if someone will help me solve these things... I will close the windows and doors tightly and put \"that thing\" by the bed. If it really comes, I will...",
