    ["怪物专攻提高<Mark>225</>。战斗中站立不动<Mark>5</>秒后怪物专攻降低<Mark>25</>，持续<Mark>5</>秒，闪避后怪物专攻提高<Mark>25</>持续<Mark>15</>秒。"] = "Monster Expertise increased by <Mark>225</>. After standing still for <Mark>5</> seconds in combat, Monster Expertise is reduced by <Mark>25</> for <Mark>5</> seconds. After dodging, Monster Expertise is increased by <Mark>25</> for <Mark>15</> seconds.",
    ["恭逢黑夜女神诞辰圣祭，圣赛缪尔教堂谨定于冬礼日举行守夜弥撒。现将当日活动安排敬告如下：\n\n时间：晚间10:00 准时开始\n地点：圣赛缪尔教堂前广场（若遇雨雪，移至教堂正厅）\n主持：安东尼·史蒂文森主教\n\n注意事项（请务必遵守）：\n守夜弥撒是我主诞辰最为神圣的仪式，请诸位信众严肃对待：\n1. 请勿迟到。弥撒准点开启，迟到者须在广场外围静立等候，待特定环节结束后方可入场。\n2. 保持肃静。仪式期间禁止交谈、喧哗、随意走动。\n3. 着装得体。建议穿着深色或素色正装，避免鲜艳色彩。\n4. 遵从引导。现场侍从将引导站位与跪拜次序，请予配合。"] = "In celebration of the Evernight Goddess's birthday, St. Samuel Cathedral has scheduled a Vigil Mass for Winter's Eve. The event schedule for the day is as follows: \n\nTime: 10:00 PM Sharp\nLocation: Plaza in front of St. Samuel Cathedral (In case of rain or snow, it will be moved to the main hall of the cathedral)\nOfficiant: Bishop Anthony Stevenson\n\nNotes (Please strictly adhere to these):\nThe Vigil Mass is the most sacred ceremony of our Lord's birth; please treat it with solemnity:\n1. Do not be late. The Mass will start on time. Latecomers must wait quietly outside the plaza and may only enter after specific segments conclude.\n2. Maintain silence. Talking, making noise, or walking around freely is prohibited during the ceremony.\n3. Dress appropriately. It is recommended to wear dark or plain formal attire; avoid bright colors.\n4. Follow guidance. Attendants on-site will guide standing positions and kneeling order; please cooperate.",
